  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk | Hudson, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards and Committees   \t\t\t \n     Our Community   \t\t\t \n     How Do I   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licensing \r\n\t\t\t\t Civil Forfeiture Fines \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Election Information \r\n\t\t\t\t November 3, 2026 State General Election Sample Ballot \r\n\t\t\t\t Absentee Voting Information \r\n\t\t\t\t Citizen's Petition Warrant Articles \r\n\t\t\t\t Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2026 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2025 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2024 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2023 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2022 Election/Results Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2021 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2020 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2019 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2018 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2017 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2016 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2015 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2014 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2013 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2012 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2011 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2010 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2009 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2008 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2007 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t 2006 Election Results/Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t NH Voter Information Look-up \r\n\t\t\t\t Polling Locations \r\n\t\t\t\t Registering to Vote \r\n\t\t\t\t Voter Traffic Patterns \r\n\t\t\t Notary Public Services \r\n\t\t\t Make a Payment Online \r\n\t\t\t Forms, Permits & Applications \r\n\t\t\t\t Vital Records (Birth, Marriage/Civil Union, Death) \r\n\t\t\t\t Landlord Agent Form \r\n\t\t\t Staff \r\n\t\t\t Intention of Marriage Worksheet \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk\t\t \r\nDepartment Responsibilities \nThe Town Clerk serves a three-year term and coordinates all elections and town meetings, assisted by the Supervisors of the Checklist. \nThe Town Clerk handles voter registration, dog licensing, and licenses (such as Vital Records and Marriage Licenses). \nNOTICE: Service Charge Increase Effective March 26, 2023 for Credit/Debit Card Purchases \nPayments \nCredit and Debit card payments are processed by Invoice Cloud. Invoice Cloud is a third-party payment provider, operating under an agreement with the Town of Hudson to process credit and debit card payment on your behalf. \nEffective March 26, 2023, if paying by credit or debit card, there will be a $2.95 charge for any transaction total $100 or less or a  service fee of 2.95%  of your total balance over $100. The 2.95% service charge is added to your payment and will appear as a separate item on your credit card statement. The service charge is not a fee assessed by your institution. \nThere is NO FEE if paying with cash or check. \nMarriage Licenses \nMarriage licenses are processed in the Town Clerk's Office Monday through Friday from 8:00 a.m. - 3:30 p.m. Both parties must be present in our office by 3:30 p.m. in order to complete the application process before the close of business. Please refer to the Marriage License tab to the left for more important information regarding marriage licenses. \nTo ensure we can serve you, please call ahead to confirm  \na clerk is available,  (603) 816-1279. \nEmilie Leclerc \nTown Clerk \n__________________ \nMain Level of Town Hall \n12 School Street \nHudson, NH 03051 \nPhone:  (603) 886-6003 \nFax:  (603) 816-1292 \nOffice Hours \nMonday - Friday \n8:00am - 4:30pm \nEmail:  Town Clerk \n___________________ \r\n\t\t\t Search \nCalendar \r\nMon, Oct. 19   \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Planning & Zoning Workshop \r\nWed, Oct. 21   \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Library Trustees  \r\nThu, Oct. 22   \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Trustees of the Trust fund \r\n\t\t         View All Events \r\n/Calendar.aspx \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Parks & Rec \r\n\t\t\t Forms & Permits \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Voting Info \r\n\t\t\t Report a Concern \r\nTown of Hudson \r\n12 School Street \r\nHudson, NH 03051 \r\nPhone:  (603) 886-6000 \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
